From d70c6e1b95694222b79b8976ec2460972ba0155b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:50:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve scratch used by live owner-tagged jobs

Veto completion, deferred parent and GC deletion while a same-user live job has a local card owner tag and cwd under the workspace. Recheck birth identity and retry naturally after exit; never signal jobs or grant permanent retention from marker files.

Proof: four real-writer regressions fail on base; two shared/child-writer regressions fail before review correction. Initial focused suite 1136 passed; revised authority/integration suite 33 passed. Opus review fixes addressed; final review, mutations, hub replay and CI pending.
